@startuml Seq_Login
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
title Sequence diagram --- Log in

actor Player
participant "Login page\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "Server" as S
database "SQLite" as DB

Player -> UI : Opens /login and submits e-mail + password
UI -> S : POST /api/auth/login
S -> DB : Find User
DB --> S : User found
S --> UI : Session cookie
UI -> S : GET /api/auth/me
S --> UI : Profile
UI --> Player : Redirect to /dashboard
@enduml
